Subject: [PATCH] Register the opt-in Wi-Fi shared-block snapshot

The first checkpoint deliberately does not map the PCIe controller. Sources
and its limited meaning are documented in docs/wifi-bringup.md.
---
--- a/osfmk/conf/files.arm64
+++ b/osfmk/conf/files.arm64
@@ -137,3 +137,5 @@
 osfmk/arm64/b2l_persistent_log.c optional b2l
 
 osfmk/arm64/b2l_acpm_dvfs.c optional b2l
+
+osfmk/arm64/b2l_wifi_diag.c optional b2l
--- a/osfmk/conf/Makefile.template
+++ b/osfmk/conf/Makefile.template
@@ -530,3 +530,6 @@
 
 # ACPM mailbox client and load governor run from a kernel thread; scalar only.
 b2l_acpm_dvfs.o_CFLAGS_ADD += -mgeneral-regs-only
+
+# Early Wi-Fi diagnostics must not borrow SIMD state.
+b2l_wifi_diag.o_CFLAGS_ADD += -mgeneral-regs-only
